          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25:1-7 Taz Yer 49:1-5; Eze 21:28-30; Amo 1:13-15; Sef 2:8-11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu lilinijia: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wewe mtu! Wageukie Waamoni, ukatoe unabii dhidi yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waambie Waamoni: Sikilizeni neno la Bwana Mwenyezi-Mungu: Nyinyi mlifurahia kuona maskani yangu ikitiwa unajisi, nchi ya Israeli ikiangamizwa na watu wa Yuda wakipelekwa uhamishoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, nitawatia nyinyi mikononi mwa watu wa mashariki; watapiga hema zao kati yenu na kufanya makazi yao katika nchi yenu. Nao watakula matunda yenu na kunywa maziwa yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mji wa Raba nitaufanya kuwa malisho ya ngamia na nchi ya Amoni zizi la kondoo. Ndipo mtakapotambua kuwa mimi ni Mwenyezi-Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mimi Bwana Mwenyezi-Mungu nasema hivi: Kwa sababu mlipiga makofi, mkarukaruka kwa furaha na kushangilia sana juu ya nchi ya Israeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "basi, mimi nimeunyosha mkono dhidi yenu; nitawaacha mtekwe nyara na watu wa mataifa mengine. Nitawaangamizeni, nanyi hamtakuwa taifa tena wala kuwa na nchi. Hapo ndipo mtakapotambua kuwa mimi ni Mwenyezi-Mungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
