          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25:15-17 Taz Isa 14:29-31; Yer 47:1-7; Yoe 3:4-8; Amo 1:6-8; Sef 2:4-7; Zek",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwana Mwenyezi-Mungu alisema hivi: “Kwa kuwa Wafilisti walifanya kisasi, wakawalipiza kisasi adui zao kwa ubaya sana na kuendelea kuwa maadui zao daima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "basi, mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu nitanyosha mkono dhidi ya Wafilisti; nitawaangamiza hao Wakerethi na wakazi wa pwani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitawalipiza kisasi kikali kwa adhabu ya ghadhabu. Ndipo watakapotambua kuwa mimi ni Mwenyezi-Mungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.17"
            ]
          }
